      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Is there anything you are concerned about\r\nin the way we fight?\r\nI'd be lying if I said I didn't.\r\nIt's nothing that would bother you, Master.",
        "Jp" : "戦い方で気になること、ですか？\r\n無い――といえば嘘になりますが\r\n主殿のお手を煩わせるほどのことではございません"
