      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Yes, indeed. Please be careful of your\r\nfooting in the outdoors.\r\nCliffs, poisonous swamps, slimes, and spiders—\r\nyou could step on something creepy or get\r\nunexpected injuries, you know.",
