      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Hehe! As with enemies or within labyrinths, I am\r\nmerely a supporting role for you, Master.\r\nTogether with you, I take delight in enacting\r\nscenes only found in grand tales...\r\nSomething incomparable to anything else.",
        "Jp" : "ふふっ！\r\n魔物や迷宮とて、さしずめ貴方の引き立て役\r\n貴方さまとともに、偉大な冒険譚の一幕を\r\n演ずる喜び――何ものにも代えがたい"
